   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"9\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Factor by substitution: <span data-math=\"(y − 4)^2 + 8(y − 4) + 15\">(y − 4)^2 + 8(y − 4) + 15</span>.</li>\n</ol>",
